<title>USA: New England Audio says to acquire HiFi Buys.</title>
<headline>New England Audio says to acquire HiFi Buys.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>New England Audio Inc said Monday that it has acquired HiFi Buys of Atlanta, Ga.</p>
<p>New England Audio said it expects this purchase to boost its combined 1997 gross sales to over $200 million and bring the total number of stores to 45 in nine states.</p>
<p>David Ginsburg, vice president of HiFi Buys, will join the New England Audio management team to oversee Atlanta operations.</p>
<p>HiFi Buys is a 10-store high-end consumer electronics chain. New New England Audio is a consumer electronics retail company selling audio, video and mobile electronics products.</p>
</text>
